What sets this document apart: it is the only one that explicitly models the 6:30–8:30 bathroom_shelf_ba1 cluster for five objects simultaneously (toiletry_bag_elena, towel_elena, skincare_elena, glasses_priya, razor_priya) and the overnight positions that differ from the naive "usual place" statistics (charger at desk_b1 rather than coffee_table_l1; water_bottle_elena at dining_table_d1 rather than sink_k1; mug_elena at sink_k1 rather than coffee_table_l1).

